Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many did we lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,14 of us died.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.21,0:02:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we still got 25 floors to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.05,0:03:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,25 more floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell are we even\Ngonna make it that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An immortal object?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:03:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander Heathcliff, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I got the answer to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reason why the Commander's HP never hits
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yellow is because he's\Nprotected by the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.37,0:04:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, ever since day one, something's\Nalways bugged me about this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was always wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where is he hiding while he watches us\Nand controls everything in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the answer's pretty simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's basic psychology.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's so simple\Nevery kid knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.59,0:04:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing more boring than\Nwatching someone else play an RPG.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there, Akihiko Kayaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just for my curiosity's sake, would you\Nmind telling me how you figured it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first time I knew something\Nwas up was during our duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember when you turned the tables on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That move was way too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.07,0:04:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a mistake to think that\Nwould go unnoticed by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:04:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you were so strong and so fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only choice I had was to\Nengage the system's assist mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am Akihiko Kayaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that my identity's been revealed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.65,0:05:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it should come as no surprise that I\Nam the final boss on the top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the strongest player in the whole\Ngame ends up being the final boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of cliche, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I kind of like that angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing's for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always thought you'd be the one\Nstanding before me at the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, dual-wielding is a rare skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the kind that's only given to the\Nplayer with the fastest reaction time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is the hero of this story, the one\Nwho rises up to challenge the Demon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you, the power you've\Ndisplayed exceeded my expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.49,0:05:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess these unexpected twists and turns
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are what makes MMORPG\Nso thrilling to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:06:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our loyalty, our hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paralysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kittito!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the plan now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.97,0:06:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna kill everyone here\Nand cover it up or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be sporting\Nof me, now would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.01,0:06:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to head for the top floor\Nand wait for all of you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be inside the Ruby Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame I have to\Nleave you all so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.35,0:06:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spent lots of time\Ndeveloping the Knights
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the Blood Oath and other elite players.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.17,0:06:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all strong, so I'm sure\Nyou'll reach me, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before I go...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, I feel you deserve some kind\Nof reward for discovering my identity,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.97,0:07:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll give you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chance for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To fight me one-on-one,\Nright here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and my immortality\Nwill be deactivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeat me and you clear the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.53,0:07:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all of the players will be\Nable to log out from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No strings attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.11,0:07:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then, let's finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:07:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't run away if it means ending this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.75,0:08:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.75,0:08:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm gonna end this world. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in you, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito! Don't! Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Egil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for supporting all the\Nplayers in the game since day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You act like you're all about the money,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I know you spent\Nevery penny you had on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,helping the intermediate players level up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klein?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I bailed on you that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think about it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.11,0:09:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare apologize now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't accept it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never accept it until we're on the\Nother side and you're buying me dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.27,0:09:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's okay, I have a final\Nrequest to make. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not planning on going down easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I die today,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.49,0:09:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want your word that you'll fix\Nit so Asuna doesn't kill herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.11,0:09:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Kirito, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do that! It's not fair! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't some in-game duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.23,0:10:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can block whatever\NI throw at him because
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he designed the dual\Nwielding skill and he knows
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.09,0:10:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all its combos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to beat him with my own power\Nwithout using the sword skills. Faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta go faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, keep living.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Game over, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, Asuna, you can't, you can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.55,0:11:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:11:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I never programmed a way for\Nplayers to neutralize their own paralysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess sometimes these\Nthings just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in you, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:15:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On November 7th at 2.55pm,\Nthe game has been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repeat, the game has been cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.50,0:15:30.59,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\an2\blur1.2\b\alpha&H33&\c&H464C4E&\frz9.45\pos(717,223.5)}Commencing final phase
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.29,0:15:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I ended up dying too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stunning view, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At Argus headquarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the SAO mainframe is in a room\Nfive floors below street level,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and right now it's deleting\Nall the data from its drives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In about ten minutes, everything in\Nthis world will disappear forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.59,0:16:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all the players?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.61,0:17:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 6,147 players who survived the game up\Nto now were logged out a few seconds ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.02,0:17:06.85,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\an2\blur1.2\fs30\b\alpha&H33&\c&H464C4E&\frz12.74\pos(651.84,427.605)}Commencing final phase
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.85,0:17:06.90,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\an2\blur1.2\fs30\b\alpha&H33&\c&H464C4E&\frz12.74\pos(651.84,427.605)}Commencing final pha{\blur3}se
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.90,0:17:11.98,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\an2\blur1.2\fs30\b\alpha&H33&\c&H464C4E&\frz12.74\pos(651.84,427.605)}Commencing final ph{\blur3}ase
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.93,0:17:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about the 4,000 people who died?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.53,0:17:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any world, real or virtual,\Nonce you're dead, you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been so long I've\Nforgotten the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.75,0:17:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even before I developed a system for the\Nfull-dive environment, I dreamed of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A castle in a world that wasn't governed\Nby earthly laws and restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I poured my life into\Nmaking that world a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:17:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I created this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:18:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I got to see something that surpassed\Nanything I could have imagined for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.93,0:18:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My steel castle floating in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember how old I was\Nwhen I became obsessed with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.09,0:18:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to leave the earth\Nto fly to that castle;
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted that more than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.95,0:18:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For as long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.47,0:18:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to believe it's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That somewhere in some other\Nworld, my castle is still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taller than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.41,0:18:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.91,0:18:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it still is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,congratulations on clearing the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Girito, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, I should\Nprobably get going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.21,0:19:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't goodbye at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be together\Nwhen we finally disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're going to be together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.71,0:19:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you never told me your real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.61,0:19:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please tell me before we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.45,0:19:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.36,0:19:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And last month I turned 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're younger than me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Asuna Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.23,0:19:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 17 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.85,0:19:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.93,0:20:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised I'd save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get you back to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.39,0:20:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.79,0:20:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy I got to meet you, Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.45,0:20:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to live with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the happiest I've\Never been in my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.95,0:20:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.81,0:20:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:21:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you so very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
